{"overview":"در حاشیهٔ یک روستای ساحلی، زنی ماهیگیر زندگی می‌کند؛ بوی بد، مجرد و همیشه مورد تمسخر قرار گرفته. روزی از خستگی به همسایگان کوچک‌فکر و محدودش، او تصمیم می‌گیرد همسر خود را از چوب بنس ساخته و در شهر محافظه‌کار، این رابطهٔ غیرمعمول باعث خشم، حسادت و آشوب می‌شود.","tagline":"","overview_en":"On the outskirts of a village by the sea, lives a Fisherwoman; smelly, single and perpetually ridiculed. One day, fed up with her stuffy, small-minded neighbours, she commissions herself a husband to be made from wicker. In an otherwise conservative town, this unconventional romance sparks outrage, jealousy and chaos.","tagline_en":"Marriage material.","runtime":105,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Eleanor Wilson","Alex Huston Fischer"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["GB","US"],"cast":[{"name":"الیویا کلمن","role":"The Fisherwoman","photo":"/lawJUdbLb1YW0niaYjiVGR9IBG8.jpg","en":"Olivia Colman"},{"name":"الکساندر اسکارشگرد","role":"The Wicker Husband","photo":"/6VNNddrSrIVgdzhXr4Zg89gmOzY.jpg","en":"Alexander Skarsgård"},{"name":"پیتر دینکلیج","role":"The Basketmaker","photo":"/9CAd7wr8QZyIN0E7nm8v1B6WkGn.jpg","en":"Peter Dinklage"},{"name":"الیزابت دبیکی","role":"The Tailor’s Wife","photo":"/nTTnQVTn13Ve4ifjRY9v8kVc99w.jpg","en":"Elizabeth Debicki"},{"name":"Marli Siu","role":"The Bottlewasher’s Wife","photo":"/pNi3TfnnJuDz25m93Nr2AKIYV4R.jpg"},{"name":"Nabhaan Rizwan","role":"The Tailor","photo":"/ljDpNmRnx9Mxe6DZbOMVZlGVXAN.jpg"},{"name":"ریچارد ای گرانت","role":"The Doctor","photo":"/92oaBntIXhndCxUXaGywUyILIIE.jpg","en":"Richard E. Grant"},{"name":"Phil Daniels","role":"The Butcher","photo":"/6yNFNjo3cWEcuAUrl0CNQnAnQ5M.jpg"},{"name":"Kiell Smith-Bynoe","role":"The Innkeeper","photo":"/6pVa2SEgMfR2u7E3xfIUGZSqinh.jpg"},{"name":"Emily Lloyd-Saini","role":"The Innkeeper’s Wife","photo":"/tW4TD9PmBGutKVhvUNXSWxZjkVn.jpg"},{"name":"Ella Bruccoleri","role":"The Bakerwoman","photo":"/xVqbUOELKqxhEdqAz5IXhFYp7Uy.jpg"},{"name":"Gustav Lindh","role":"The